# Send a trip itinerary via the Travel Agent (Message MCP)
# Requires the app running locally: ./mvnw spring-boot:run
# Runnable directly from the IntelliJ HTTP Client (click the ▶ gutter icon).
# Edit the variables below as needed.

@host = http://localhost:8080
@phone = <YOUR_VERIFIED_NUMBER>
@conversationId = travel-agent-manual-test

### Send an itinerary over Viber
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json
X-Conversation-Id: {{conversationId}}

{
  "prompt": "Plan my trip from Munich to Zadar for the Infobip Shift conference, 12-16 September 2026, 4 days, no special preferences. Then send the itinerary via Viber to {{phone}}."
}

### Check delivery status (same conversation, so the agent recalls the messageId from the send above)
POST {{host}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json
X-Conversation-Id: {{conversationId}}

{
  "prompt": "Was that itinerary delivered?"
}
